{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At <strong>Cloudydale High School,</strong> an ordinary <strong>Pomodore 64</strong> becomes the stuff of 8-bit nightmares after being corrupted by a mysterious cassette\u2014one that unlocks malevolent intelligence and a thirst for domination. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761220/extras/817d4d539eaa42f7a39617b5bed2b9f6.gif?t=1772701821\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761220/extras/817d4d539eaa42f7a39617b5bed2b9f6.poster.avif?t=1772701821\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now supercharged and sentient, the <strong>Evil Pomodore</strong> seizes control of an army of classic villains\u2014aliens, mole men, dinosaurs, and zombies\u2014bent on conquering Cloudydale... and then the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only one group stands in its way: <strong>Blueberry Finn</strong>, the alternative rock trio of <strong>Hank, Duck, and Alex</strong>. Armed with their wits, instruments, and a serious grudge against evil hardware, the band is back to save the world\u2014again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761220/extras/02997b03e2547020508e5a16649baadb.poster.avif?t=1772701821\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761220/extras/02997b03e2547020508e5a16649baadb.webm?t=1772701821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761220/extras/02997b03e2547020508e5a16649baadb.mp4?t=1772701821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURING:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c9 Tongue-in-cheek Humour.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c9 Switch freely between three playable characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c9 Experience three different, yet intertwined storylines!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c9 Elegant point 'n' click control of character, with &quot;Mouth&quot;, &quot;Hand&quot; and &quot;Eye&quot; interface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c9 Ideal for newcomers to the genre, familiar and nostalgic for veterans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c9 Fight your battles to the last combo with Music, thanks to the Music Battle System.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c9 Every choice matters: Different endings to discover based on your choices.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2761220?t=1772701821","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761220/dc99f09cdf5cddec7fdb4c8b787f65ada16155dc/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772701821","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761220/cd7837e058a37532eaa1f872f6fac0b59e465ec2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772701821","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761220/cd7837e058a37532eaa1f872f6fac0b59e465ec2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772701821","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3967930,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At <strong>Cloudydale High School,</strong> an ordinary <strong>Pomodore 64</strong> becomes the stuff of 8-bit nightmares after being corrupted by a mysterious cassette\u2014one that unlocks malevolent intelligence and a thirst for domination. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761220/extras/817d4d539eaa42f7a39617b5bed2b9f6.gif?t=1772701821\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761220/extras/817d4d539eaa42f7a39617b5bed2b9f6.poster.avif?t=1772701821\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now supercharged and sentient, the <strong>Evil Pomodore</strong> seizes control of an army of classic villains\u2014aliens, mole men, dinosaurs, and zombies\u2014bent on conquering Cloudydale... and then the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only one group stands in its way: <strong>Blueberry Finn</strong>, the alternative rock trio of <strong>Hank, Duck, and Alex</strong>. Armed with their wits, instruments, and a serious grudge against evil hardware, the band is back to save the world\u2014again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761220/extras/02997b03e2547020508e5a16649baadb.poster.avif?t=1772701821\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761220/extras/02997b03e2547020508e5a16649baadb.webm?t=1772701821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761220/extras/02997b03e2547020508e5a16649baadb.mp4?t=1772701821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURING:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c9 Tongue-in-cheek Humour.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c9 Switch freely between three playable characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c9 Experience three different, yet intertwined storylines!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c9 Elegant point 'n' click control of character, with &quot;Mouth&quot;, &quot;Hand&quot; and &quot;Eye&quot; interface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c9 Ideal for newcomers to the genre, familiar and nostalgic for veterans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c9 Fight your battles to the last combo with Music, thanks to the Music Battle System.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c9 Every choice matters: Different endings to discover based on your choices.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Duck Made Of Wood"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761220/f4c8f1044acf18177f6f9554dc2aa596167e6512/header.jpg?t=1772701821","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 14.04, Mint 17 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.5 GHz Single Core Processor or 2 GHz Dual Core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 2.0 compatible with 1 GB RAM (Shared Memory is not recommended)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 MB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10.15 Catalina or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.5 GHz (Single Core) or 2 GHz (Dual Core)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> D graphics card compatible with OpenGL 2.0 compatible with 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 900 MB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2761220/1292153890/47d1f1b6997af4ab150789c01ee086cb8279b527/1770676631/dash_av1.mpd?t=1770677569","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2761220/1292153890/47d1f1b6997af4ab150789c01ee086cb8279b527/1770676631/dash_h264.mpd?t=1770677569","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2761220/1292153890/47d1f1b6997af4ab150789c01ee08